Feature: Linux systray: Add https://github.com/AyatanaIndicators/libayatana-appindicator-glib to third_party/appindicator

Snapshot of Release 2.0.3 committed on 14 June 2026, taken 14 August 2026.

Steps: Prepare the source on a Linux machine:
git clone https://github.com/AyatanaIndicators/libayatana-appindicator-glib
Following https://github.com/AyatanaIndicators/libayatana-appindicator-glib/blob/main/INSTALL.md:
Install dependencies:
sudo apt-get install cmake cmake-extras gobject-introspection libgirepository1.0-dev valac

cd libayatana-appindicator-glib
mkdir build
cd build
cmake ..
make

This is not 100% successful, but sufficient to grab the following source files from src/ and build/src:
application-service-marshal.c
application-service-marshal.h
